 write('input_audit.md',f'''# Comment5.5输入与封存审计\n\n结论{inputval['status']}；求解前权威表/求解器核验{pre['status']}。本地权威与预期关闭数量一致：{closedtext}。仅7情景可选不同十路集合，1002/1006/1010为no_alternative_set。\n\n{inputs}\n\n## 原预选规则身份\n\n使用老家原day2归档的preprocessor、selection_freeze、selection_audit及正式select_final_recoverable_roads.py。preprocessor路径`{PRE}`，SHA256 `{sha(PRE)}`，与原冻结selection_freeze及4.1正式快照一致。只读取其中38个baseline_flow和betweenness，不载入权重、不作代理预测。\n\n在每情景初始关闭集合内用descending minimum rank，(n−rank)/(n−1)，各0.5得分，按combined↓/flow↓/betweenness↓/ID↑排序。10/10原集合及bit顺序精确复现，原静态指标/分值逐道路核对通过。原物理输入`{PHYS}`的SHA256为`{sha(PHYS)}`；其与原selection_freeze逐字节一致。原audit `{SEL/'01_road_selection/candidate_road_selection_audit.csv'}`，hash `{sha(SEL/'01_road_selection/candidate_road_selection_audit.csv')}`；原metadata `{SEL/'01_road_selection/final_scenarios.json'}`，hash `{sha(SEL/'01_road_selection/final_scenarios.json')}`。\n\n## 新集合规则与冻结\n\nA1按震前flow↓/betweenness↓/ID↑；A2按betweenness↓/flow↓/ID↑；A3仅在关闭>10且A1=A2=A0时触发，本地仅1009，换入38、换出25，为诊断压力测试。所有规则31个标签映射到20个实际集合；未制造相同集合的替代样本。新集合bit顺序按ID升序，A0保留原bit顺序。状态身份采用scenario+实际恢复道路无序物理mask（ID−1对应bit），而不是集合局部mask。\n\nrun_manifest写入时间{man['created_utc']}，SHA256 `{freeze55['run_manifest_sha256']}`。第一次新UE或任何DP前已锁定全部映射、各集合未恢复道路、跨集合联合状态及代码hash。无随机种子，均为确定性规则。unique_requested_states.csv SHA256 `{freeze55['requested_states_sha256']}`。原/新20集合共20480个子集通道，去重为15232个DP物理状态；反事实再加7个新状态，总计15239。复用10240，新增4992+7=4999；其余3反事实与A0终态相同。\n\n## 权威成本表与版本\n\n{hashtable}\n\n全部10×1024 mask完整、有限、converged且RG≤1e-9。源代码 `{BASE/'code/ue_solver.py'}` SHA256 `{sha(BASE/'code/ue_solver.py')}`；`{BASE/'code/path_ue.py'}` SHA256 `{sha(BASE/'code/path_ue.py')}`；两者分别与4.2 S0来源清单核对，solver/network/OD/tolerance上下文hash `{man['solver_version']}` 与已验收5.2一致。旧FW5e-4表不用于数值，旧SQLite不打开。新缓存只在cache/portfolio_states.sqlite3。\n\n新解冷启动，单进程/核，RG1e-9，最多20000 outer；原内部迭代规则不改，不做放宽精度回退。每状态528正需求OD有向可达、有限、守恒，所有新解独立重算BPR，57个预定样本用heap-Dijkstra复核间隙。正常新调用4999、缓存读命中0（在求解前先物理去重）、失败0。并非B=256在线成本。\n\n## 单位与5.2桥接\n\n沿用4.2原T0_raw={T0:.17g}，Q=360600、时间单位0.01h。TSTT转veh·h只乘0.01，ATT分钟=0.6 TSTT_raw/Q；S0…S9等权0.1，S10权重0但实际成本非零。5.2重新求得的dry baseline略异，因此本轮保留原目标基准，直接比较5.2的A0终态TSTT/ATT和道路计数，10/10一致；不强行宣称两个不同分母的ratio逐位一致。没有重新求干燥UE。\n\n4.1—5.4及旧响应文件均只读；完整基线audit/source_sha256.json共{preserve['checked_files']}项，最终逐项复核全部一致。新研究没有改变原洪水、OD、容量、BPR、原Full或模型。\n''')
 report=f'''# Reviewer1 Comment5.5 中文技术与最终验收报告\n\n**状态：{status}；{npassed}/{ntotal}项验收通过。** 该状态只表示本轮授权模拟和交付质量通过，不代表原十路集合全局最优或现实应急恢复方案已得到验证。新增UE4999次（4992子集+7反事实），全部RG≤1e-9；新增洪水0、训练0、代理预测0、原Full重跑0。\n\n## 1. 主要发现\n\n原50/50选路集合不是一个已证明最优的干预组合。7个可选情景中，{len(improved)}个（{', '.join(map(str,improved.scenario_id.astype(int))) }）存在累计目标更好的事前固定替代集合。10个实际不同替代集合中，{len(better)}个改善、{len(worse)}个恶化，没有删掉不利结果。1002/1006/1010恰好10条关闭，无法在“从原关闭道路恰选10条”范围内另选。\n\n最大改善为1003 Flow-only（换入19，换出7）：原J*={scenario[scenario.scenario_id.eq(1003)].A0_J.iloc[0]:.12f}，替代J*={r1003.J_star:.12f}，selection_gain={r1003.selection_gain_pct:.9f}%（原A0作分母），对应模型阶段平均单次出行时间差{r1003.delta_model_ATT_minutes:.9f}分钟。A0相对该情景best among tested sets的gap为{g1003:.9f}%（最优测试集作分母），两个百分比分母不同，不能混写。最坏替代是{worst.portfolio_id}、{worst.labels}，选择收益{worst.selection_gain_pct:.9f}%，分钟差{worst.delta_model_ATT_minutes:.9f}，完整保留。\n\n累计最优与终态残余最小不是同一目标。按每情景best-tested集合比较，1004和1009的两类最优集合不相同；逐替代比较还包括1003 A2等“累计改善、终态恶化”的情况。1004全部原关闭道路恢复的反事实TSTT比原十路终态略高，未强制施加单调性。\n\n## 2. 冻结输入与计算规模\n\n{inputs}\n\n原预选使用原preprocessor里的震前flow与betweenness，descending minimum rank归一化，各0.5；原集合10/10复现。Flow-only与Betweenness-only按冻结规则执行；仅1009触发A3，换入38、换出25，只是诊断stress test。31个规则标签去重为20个实际十路集合，其中原10、替代10。无随机选集和结果驱动调整。run_manifest与unique_requested_states在新UE/DP前封存，来源见input_audit.md。\n\n20×1024=20480个DP通道跨集合去重为15232物理状态，避免重复求解5248个DP通道；10240个已验收4.2状态只读复用，真正新DP状态4992。另7个全关闭道路恢复反事实，总独立状态15239。3个恰好十关闭情景的反事实直接复用A0 S10。新物理缓存命中0是因为求解前已完成联合去重，不代表未共享状态。首次新UE前确认总新增4999≤6000。\n\n## 3. 完整条件DP结果\n\n正的selection_gain_pct表示替代集合更好，负值表示更差。A0与所有替代均使用各自完整1024状态的全信息条件DP；从未把原Full序列强行放入包含不同道路的新集合。\n\n{resulttable}\n\n只可称best among tested sets，不是联合选集合+排序的global optimum。本轮没有优化组合选择规则，也没有将这些离线oracle称为B=256算法。各集合平均阶段TSTT veh·h/ATT分钟、入出道路、共同道路相对顺序及分母详见Table_portfolio_DP_comparison.csv。不对不同元素全排列直接计算Kendall tau；只在共同道路子序列上计算，明确共同道路对数。\n\n## 4. 终态残余与反事实\n\n原A0的S10仍有0—2条初始关闭道路未恢复，其中7/10场景为1或2条；10个情景各有10—18条原可通行涉水道路继续保持降速。A0终态模型ATT范围{tt0.terminal_ATT_minutes.min():.9f}—{tt0.terminal_ATT_minutes.max():.9f}分钟；所有测试集合终态范围{t.terminal_ATT_minutes.min():.9f}—{t.terminal_ATT_minutes.max():.9f}。S10不是零成本，仅在原目标中权重为零，不能叫fully recovered network。\n\n{terminaltable}\n\n全部原关闭道路恢复后，原湿开放道路仍保留洪水效应，不代表所有湿道路变干：\n\n{cftable}\n\n以同一干燥基准作**代数、有符号分解**：TSTT(S10_E)−T0=[TSTT(S10_E)−TSTT(F)]+[TSTT(F)−T0]。原单位和veh·h两种量纲逐集合核验通过。第一项可以为负；1004 A0为{term1004.terminal_minus_allclosed_veh_h:.9f} veh·h，A0终态ATT {term1004.terminal_ATT_minutes:.9f}分钟，而全关闭恢复反事实为{cf1004.ATT_allclosed_minutes:.9f}分钟。该现象与UE再均衡的非单调性/Braess型现象相容，但不证明工程因果归因，也不能转化为建议现实保持封路。其余正负值完整保存，未截为零。\n\n全部原关闭道路恢复反事实ATT范围{cf.ATT_allclosed_minutes.min():.9f}—{cf.ATT_allclosed_minutes.max():.9f}分钟，仍高于原干燥基准{.6*T0/Q:.9f}分钟。残余湿路影响的有符号代数项不是因果损失分摊。\n\n## 5. 数学、单位和独立验收\n\nW(empty)=0；W(S)=min_e[W(S−e)+C(S−e)]，J*=W(E)/10。另实现V(empty)=C(empty)、V(S)=min_e[V(S−e)+1[S≠E]C(S)]，以及独立逆向剩余动作DP。20/20完整1024状态、前驱链、三种递推与逐序列S0…S9显式求和全部通过；10/10 A0复现4.2原高精度J*和既有序列目标，A0终态TSTT/ATT与5.2一致。m1…7的穷举、V/W/H、终态哨兵和初态增量共35项通过。最大DP跨实现绝对差{dp.max_abs_difference.max():.12g}。\n\n全部4999新解重新检查有限性、RG、528正OD有向可达与守恒；最大RG {ue['max_RG']:.12g}，最大守恒误差{ue['max_conservation_error']:.12g}。另用独立NumPy BPR从4999个流量向量重算TSTT，最大相对差{flow['max_TSTT_relative_difference']:.12g}；57个事前固定样本用独立heap-Dijkstra复算SPTT，最大RG {flow['max_sample_RG']:.12g}。未放宽精度、不把未收敛状态写缓存。RG不是严格TSTT误差数学界，DP只对冻结成本表精确。\n\nQ=360600；TNTP原时间0.01h，转veh·h乘一次0.01，ATT分钟=0.6TSTT_raw/Q。T0_raw={T0:.17g}沿用4.2，保留与5.2重算干燥基准的微小数值桥接，不重复换算。分钟数是固定需求/无硬上限BPR的静态模型结果，不是实测车辆时间、工程耗时、真实累计延误或社会成本。\n\n## 6. 来源保护与图形验收\n\n旧来源{preserve['unchanged_files']}/{preserve['checked_files']}项SHA256全部一致，包括5.2全部{preserve['comment5_2_files']}文件及5.4全部{preserve['comment5_4_files']}文件。Git {preserve['git_branch']}、HEAD {preserve['git_head']}不变；仅comment5_5新增内容。原模型、主稿、旧响应及旧SQLite未写。\n\n两幅图均实际PNG目检、PDF嵌入字体且最小7pt、600dpiPNG、1.5pt多面板对齐PASS；两次PDF碰撞审计均零FAIL/零WARN。源码预检唯一WARN为未提供TIFF，而本协议要求PDF/PNG/SVG，已按要求完整提供。图中保留改善、恶化、相同集合和三个无可替换集合情景，表格保留高精度原值。\n\n初次分析脚本存在一个索引括号语法错误，在产生分析数值前修正，原报错日志保留logs/initial_analysis_parser_failure.txt；未影响冻结选集、UE源码、UE状态或参数，未新增求解。最终分析与独立CSV验收均通过。\n\n## 7. 尚未解决的科学与整稿事项\n\n有限替代规则不能证明全局最优干预组合；本轮只是固定十行动范围的条件UE-DP敏感性。十个独立合成、始终连通的洪水情景，其中七个有选路自由度，不做显著性检验、不膨胀独立样本数。未模拟断网恢复、实测水动力、道路开放安全、多队伍、异质工期、动态需求/洪水、可达性、未服务交通、人口公平或工程费用。等工期与5.4分开，不改变5.4结果或4.4扩规模结论。既有累计UE恢复/Bellman结构不是本轮数学创新，最终文献归属沿用5.1；也不冲销5.1中UE-only强基线的不利结论。\n\n英文回复、Methods/Results/Discussion/Supplement建议与图注已交付，页码/行号待master merge，**未修改任何旧Word/正式Response**。数值与图形没有未关闭阻断；现实外推局限与作者整稿合并仍待处理。\n\n## 8. 文件与停止\n\nREADME_文件索引.md为完整索引；output_manifest.csv记录全部输出hash。原始状态、全部新UE流量和查询日志、完整DP/轨迹与独立核验均保留。重现脚本默认只读既有数值，不再调用UE，并将重算写到本目录独立reproductions子目录。本轮完成后停止，不打包、不扩展其他数据集或优化。\n'''
 write('Comment5_5_results_report_CN.md',report)
 response=f'''# Reviewer 1 Comment 5.5 — response draft\n\n**Status for author review.** The additional numerical experiment and evidence files are complete. Master-manuscript integration and final page/line locations are pending; this draft does not assert that the original Word or Supplement has already been changed.\n\n## Comment\n\n{quote}\n\n## Reply\n\nWe agree that a low ordering regret within a preselected ten-road set does not establish the quality of that set or a complete recovery plan. We therefore tested alternative preselection rules under conditional exact UE-DP for the fixed ten-action scope, and separately quantified terminal residual disruption. These are post-study full-information sensitivity benchmarks, not additional budgeted searches or a global joint selected-set/order optimum.\n\n**Preselection audit and alternatives.** We reconstructed the original50/50 rule from the frozen pre-flood physical-road flow and betweenness values, using descending minimum ranks normalized within each initial closed set and the archived tie rules. All ten original sets and their bit mappings matched. The original scenarios contain11,10,12,11,12,10,11,12,11,10 closed roads. Consequently, only seven admit different legal ten-road sets; scenarios1002,1006 and1010 admit none. Before reading new UE results, we froze Flow-only and Betweenness-only sets, retaining aliases when a rule reproduced the original set. Only scenario1009 met the prespecified diagnostic-swap trigger, replacing road25 with road38. This swap is a diagnostic stress test, not an operational policy. The31 rule labels correspond to20 distinct sets, including ten alternatives.\n\nWe reused10,240 accepted high-precision original subset costs. Cross-set physical-state deduplication required4,992 new subset solves and seven additional all-original-closures-restored counterfactual solves. All4,999 converged at RG≤1e-9 using the unchanged accepted solver, OD and flood parameters; no new flood, training, proxy prediction or Full rerun was performed. All twenty complete1,024-state conditional DPs passed three recurrences and explicit path checks, and all ten original references reproduced the accepted high-precision objectives. This Bellman formulation applies an established cumulative UE recovery structure; we do not claim the recurrence as a new mathematical contribution.\n\n**Selection sensitivity.** Five distinct alternative sets improved the conditional cumulative objective and five worsened it. A better tested set existed in scenarios1003,1004 and1008, three of the seven with selection freedom. The largest gain was scenario1003 Flow-only, replacing road7 with road19. The conditional optimum decreased from{scenario[scenario.scenario_id.eq(1003)].A0_J.iloc[0]:.9f} to{r1003.J_star:.9f}, a{r1003.selection_gain_pct:.6f}% reduction relative to the original reference, corresponding to a{r1003.delta_model_ATT_minutes:.6f} min reduction in average-static-stage model-implied trip time. The original reference's gap to the best tested set was{g1003:.6f}% using the best-tested objective as denominator. Conversely, the largest worsening was{abs(worst.selection_gain_pct):.6f}% under scenario1005 Betweenness-only. These directions and all unchanged cases are retained. The findings show that the original heuristic can exclude roads that improve the objective within these tested alternatives. They do not identify an optimal intervention portfolio among all possible sets, nor do they establish a surrogate advantage over adaptive UE-only search.\n\n**Terminal residual disruption.** Completion of the original ten interventions leaves one or two initially closed roads unrepaired in seven scenarios and none in three. Across all ten,10–18 initially open wet roads continue to experience flood-related degradation. Original terminal ATT ranges from{tt0.terminal_ATT_minutes.min():.6f} to{tt0.terminal_ATT_minutes.max():.6f} model-implied minutes. The terminal state has zero weight in the ten-stage objective, not zero traffic cost. Restoring every initially closed road, while keeping initially open wet roads degraded, yields{cf.ATT_allclosed_minutes.min():.6f}–{cf.ATT_allclosed_minutes.max():.6f} min, compared with the original dry reference of{.6*T0/Q:.6f} min. Thus neither counterfactual denotes a completely dry or fully recovered network. Residual road IDs, depths, pre-flood flows and betweenness are provided for every tested set.\n\nCumulative and terminal objectives need not agree. The best tested cumulative and terminal sets differ in scenarios1004 and1009. We retained the signed decomposition TSTT(S10_E)−T0=[TSTT(S10_E)−TSTT(F)]+[TSTT(F)−T0], without assuming that reopening more roads necessarily lowers equilibrium TSTT. In scenario1004, the original terminal ATT is{term1004.terminal_ATT_minutes:.6f} min and the all-initial-closures-restored counterfactual is{cf1004.ATT_allclosed_minutes:.6f} min; the first signed term is{term1004.terminal_minus_allclosed_veh_h:.6f} veh·h. This nonmonotonic static-model outcome is compatible with UE re-equilibration, rather than evidence for keeping real roads closed. The decomposition is an algebraic comparison, not a causal attribution of disaster losses.\n\n**Scope and practical interpretation.** There are ten independent synthetic floods, seven with selection freedom; multiple sets are not additional independent floods and no significance claim is made. Absolute times retain the fixed-demand, uncapped-BPR static stress-test interpretation. All experiment states remain connected, and reopening orders do not confer engineering or safety permission. The experiment keeps one sequential crew, equal action durations and immediate restoration. It does not add crew access, dynamic water or traffic, unserved-demand penalties, critical-facility objectives, equity or engineering cost. The separate heterogeneous-duration sensitivity is unchanged. The exactness claim applies to the stored conditional state tables, not a mathematically exact continuous UE optimum.\n\n## Proposed action and evidence\n\n- Replace any phrase equating completion of selected interventions with full network recovery. State the preselection restriction in Methods and the main conclusions.\n- Add the observed positive and negative selection sensitivity and endpoint trade-offs to Results. Place all rule aliases, state reuse, conditional DP, residual-road metadata and signed decompositions in Supplementary Information.\n- Retain the selected-set/global-plan distinction and the unresolved operational limitations in Discussion. Suggested text is in `Manuscript_insertions_Comment5.5_EN.md`. [PAGE/LINE TO BE FILLED AFTER MASTER MERGE.]\n\nEvidence is supplied in `Table_portfolio_DP_comparison.csv`, `Table_terminal_residual_by_portfolio.csv`, `Table_allclosed_counterfactual.csv`, `Table_selection_rules_all10.csv`, `Table_scenario_selection_summary.csv`, both `Figure_R1_5_5_*` figures and the complete raw/audit records.\n\n## 中文作者核对（提交英文回复时移除）\n\n原集合并未被证明最优，3/7可选情景找到更好测试集合；10替代集合5改善5恶化。selection_gain和原集合对best-tested的gap分母不同。S10权重0不等于成本0；全原关闭道路恢复也不是全湿路变干。保留1004非单调结果及1004/1009目标冲突。新结果不证明代理优势，不改4.1—5.4。主稿/旧回复未合并，页码待作者最后确定。\n'''
 # Normalize spacing in prose without touching identifiers or source quote.
 for a,b in [('original50','original 50'),('the31','the 31'),('to20','to 20'),('reused10','reused 10'),('required4','required 4'),('All4','All 4'),('twenty complete1','twenty complete 1'),('scenarios100','scenarios 100'),('scenario100','scenario 100'),('road25','road 25'),('road38','road 38'),('road7','road 7'),('road19','road 19'),('Across all ten,10','Across all ten, 10')]:response=response.replace(a,b)
